-- الدايرة فوق يمين القايمة (يمين عنوان "الي قيمو سكربتك") وتطلع بنعومة: تظهر وتنزل شوي شوي
local SPIN_HIDDEN_POS = UDim2.new(0.5, 105, 0, 6)
local SPIN_SHOWN_POS = UDim2.new(0.5, 105, 0, 14)
local spinnerShown = false

local function showSpinner(dur)
	if spinnerShown then return end
	spinnerShown = true
	local info = TweenInfo.new(dur or 0.5, Enum.EasingStyle.Quad, Enum.EasingDirection.Out)
	SkyTw(spinner, info, {BackgroundTransparency = 0.08, Position = SPIN_SHOWN_POS}):Play()
	SkyTw(spinStroke, info, {Transparency = 0}):Play()
end

local function hideSpinner()
	if not spinnerShown then return end
	spinnerShown = false
	local info = TweenInfo.new(0.45, Enum.EasingStyle.Quad, Enum.EasingDirection.Out)
	SkyTw(spinner, info, {BackgroundTransparency = 1, Position = SPIN_HIDDEN_POS}):Play()
	SkyTw(spinStroke, info, {Transparency = 1}):Play()
end

local function doRefresh()
	if refreshing then return end
	refreshing = true
	showSpinner(0.35)
	local started = os.clock()
	task.spawn(function()
		local fresh = fetchEntries()
		local left = 0.9 - (os.clock() - started)
		if left > 0 then task.wait(left) end
		if gui and gui.Parent then
			if fresh then
				buildRows(fresh)
				local t = newestTs(fresh)
				if t > seenTs then seenTs = t; saveSeen(t) end
			end
			hideSpinner()
		end
		refreshing = false
	end)
end

task.spawn(function()
	while gui and gui.Parent do
		if refreshing then spinGrad.Rotation = (spinGrad.Rotation + 14) % 360 end
		task.wait(0.03)
	end
end)

local function isPress(i)
	return i.UserInputType == Enum.UserInputType.Touch or i.UserInputType == Enum.UserInputType.MouseButton1
end
local function isMove(i)
	return i.UserInputType == Enum.UserInputType.Touch or i.UserInputType == Enum.UserInputType.MouseMovement
end

local conns = {}
table.insert(conns, list.InputBegan:Connect(function(input)
	if not isPress(input) or refreshing then return end
	if list.CanvasPosition.Y <= 2 then
		dragStartY = input.Position.Y
		pullDist = 0
	else
		dragStartY = nil
	end
end))
table.insert(conns, UIS.InputChanged:Connect(function(input)
	if not dragStartY or refreshing or not isMove(input) then return end
	if list.CanvasPosition.Y > 2 then
		dragStartY = input.Position.Y
		pullDist = 0
		hideSpinner()
		return
	end
	pullDist = math.max(0, input.Position.Y - dragStartY)
	if pullDist > 6 then showSpinner(0.5) end
	spinGrad.Rotation = (pullDist * 5) % 360
end))
table.insert(conns, UIS.InputEnded:Connect(function(input)
	if not dragStartY or not isPress(input) then return end
	local d = pullDist
	dragStartY, pullDist = nil, 0
	if refreshing then return end
	if d >= PULL_NEED then
		doRefresh()
	else
		hideSpinner()
	end
end))
gui.Destroying:Connect(function()
	for _, c in ipairs(conns) do c:Disconnect() end
end)

